557635\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"testimonial.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-testimonial-wrapper{overflow:hidden;text-align:center}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-content{font-size:1.3em;margin-bottom:20px}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-name{line-height:1.5;display:block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-job{font-size:.85em;display:block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta{width:100%;line-height:1}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta-inner{display:inline-block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta .elementor-testimonial-details,.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta .elementor-testimonial-image{display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta .elementor-testimonial-image img{width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;-o-object-fit:cover;object-fit:cover;max-width:none}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-aside .elementor-testimonial-image{padding-right:15px}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-aside .elementor-testimonial-details{text-align:left}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-top .elementor-testimonial-details,.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-top .elementor-testimonial-image{display:block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-top .elementor-testimonial-image{margin-bottom:20px}<\/style>\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-content\">\"Parab\u00e9ns a toda a equipa Devlop pelo processo de aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o dos ativos da U.B.S. e pela expans\u00e3o para o Porto! Certamente vai fortalecer a nossa presen\u00e7a na regi\u00e3o e facilitar a colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com os principais players da supply chain. <br>\nMantemos a vis\u00e3o de liderar a digitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o do setor, necess\u00e1ria, especialmente com os desafios tecnol\u00f3gicos que se aproximam. A desmaterializa\u00e7\u00e3o dos documentos de transporte e a integra\u00e7\u00e3o com os ecossistemas digitais s\u00e3o passos cruciais para modernizar e otimizar a cadeia de valor de todos os seus shareholders.\n \nBem-vinda a equipa Devlop do Porto!\"<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-meta elementor-has-image elementor-testimonial-image-position-aside\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-meta-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"371\" height=\"350\" src=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/1-20.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-11695\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/1-20.png 371w, https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/1-20-300x283.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 371px) 100vw, 371px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-details\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-name\">\t Hugo Duarte da Fonseca<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-job\">Managing Partner - Devlop<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35c474a elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"35c474a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ee1358 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0ee1358\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Esta aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o permitir-nos-\u00e1 ganhar escala, e oferecer solu\u00e7\u00f5es mais especializadas e inovadoras para responder \u00e0s necessidades do setor dos Transportes e Log\u00edstica, assegurando simultaneamente uma presen\u00e7a f\u00edsica mais pr\u00f3xima na\u00a0<strong>regi\u00e3o Norte<\/strong>, atrav\u00e9s da\u00a0<strong>Devlop Porto<\/strong>, com uma equipa comercial e t\u00e9cnica dedicada ao apoio das empresas desta regi\u00e3o.<\/p><p>Estamos entusiasmados com as oportunidades que esta integra\u00e7\u00e3o nos proporciona e motivados para continuar a desenvolver solu\u00e7\u00f5es personalizadas que contribuam para o sucesso dos nossos clientes.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45f4936 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"45f4936\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9dfa761 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"9dfa761\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-98d64b1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"98d64b1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa9e427 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fa9e427\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Convite \u00e0 Transforma\u00e7\u00e3o Digital<\/h5>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6bcb9b1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6bcb9b1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1e0c175 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1e0c175\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Com a integra\u00e7\u00e3o da UBS, convidamos todas as empresas a agendar reuni\u00f5es connosco para analisarmos as suas necessidades espec\u00edficas de transforma\u00e7\u00e3o digital. Este \u00e9 o momento ideal para aproveitar os incentivos do programa Portugal 2030, que podem ser um motor importante de inova\u00e7\u00e3o e crescimento.<\/p><p>Para mais informa\u00e7\u00f5es, contacte-nos atrav\u00e9s de: <strong><a href=\"mailto:sales@devlop.systems\" rel=\"noopener\">sales@devlop.systems<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-70e1e00 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"70e1e00\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a8a77b elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"4a8a77b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c2b4095 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c2b4095\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a1c970c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a1c970c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"\" data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"393\"><strong data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"393\">Ao longo dos \u00faltimos 26 anos, temos consolidado a nossa posi\u00e7\u00e3o como uma refer\u00eancia no mercado portugu\u00eas de TI, com um foco particular nas PME e na Digital Supply Chain, fornecendo solu\u00e7\u00f5es tecnol\u00f3gicas que transformam a forma como as empresas operam.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"625\">Com esta integra\u00e7\u00e3o, refor\u00e7amos o nosso compromisso em investir no futuro dos nossos clientes, assegurando que t\u00eam \u00e0 sua disposi\u00e7\u00e3o as ferramentas e solu\u00e7\u00f5es essenciais para prosperar num mundo cada vez mais digital e competitivo.<\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"815\">Com uma vis\u00e3o voltada para o futuro, continuaremos a crescer e a inovar, promovendo a evolu\u00e7\u00e3o e a transforma\u00e7\u00e3o digital das empresas em Portugal, de forma ainda mais eficiente e eficaz.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-771d7df e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"771d7df\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fa52b1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3fa52b1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-f4c5a74 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default eleme